{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-03-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS AND SARGAS ANNOUNCE AGREEMENT TO BUILD ADDITIONAL AIR SEPARATION UNIT AT JINDAL SHADEED IRON & STEEL IN SOHAR, OMAN', 'text': "LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. AND SOHAR, OMAN, MARCH 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) A WORLD LEADER IN INDUSTRIAL GASES, TOGETHER WITH THEIR REGIONAL PARTNER SAUDI ARABIAN REFRIGERANT GASES COMPANY OF SAUDI ARABIA (SARGAS) – AN AFFILIATED COMPANY OF ABDULLAH HASHIM GASES AND EQUIPMENT, AIR PRODUCTS' LONG STANDING INDUSTRIAL GAS JOINT VENTURE IN THE KINGDOM OF SAUDI ARABIA - TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO BUILD A NEW AIR SEPARATION UNIT (ASU) AT JINDAL SHADEED IRON & STEEL FACILITY IN SOHAR, OMAN."}